# Loaded automatically by the electron-builder CLI (dotenv).
#
# Portable/NSIS 7z archives are built with -mx=9 ("ultra") by default, which
# takes ~100s on this project. Level 3 is ~5s and only grows the exe by a few
# MB (most of the payload is already-compressed Chromium files). The full
# pipeline drops from ~2m to ~30s. Raise to 6-9 for a smaller release exe.
ELECTRON_BUILDER_COMPRESSION_LEVEL=3
